      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this is an impl decision.  The idea is to have a boolean true/false armed/disarmed.  This is set to armed when the command is sent.\n\nWe could have one disarmed/arming/armed/disarming, but wouldn\u0027t be a boolean, and then the arming/disarming would be the time between create_connection and cancel_connect command/command_status.\n\nI chose the former b/c it\u0027s less complex, and I don\u0027t think we need the granularity of the latter.\n\nLet me know what you think",
