      "side": 1,
      "message": "This goes the the previous comment; the connectability_armed_ flag shadows the actual state of the hardware, and hence is only an approximation.\n\nSo we either set it armed when the command is sent (and clear if command status fails), or set on command status is received if success.\n\nI worry about the latter if one connect_request is pending, and then we send another one b/c we don\u0027t set connectability_armed_ until command status is received.\n\nThen we\u0027d need to go to a more granular set of flags (disarmed/arming/armed/disarming)",
      "parentUuid": "5abc14a3_9c5b7117",
